				<description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;trip-report&#34;&gt;Trip Report&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The hike to Chasm Lake next to longs peak.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/gear_layout.jpg&#34;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;alt=&#34;A mountain peak with sparse snow over a hazy morning cloud&#34;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;h4&gt;My gear for this hike&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We started the day off and left from golden at around 4 am and arrived at about 6 at the base of the trailhead. There was already a little bit of first light.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/longs_face.jpg&#34;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;alt=&#34;Taken at 14,278 ft during my first winter summit.&#34;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;h4&gt;Mt Meeker&amp;#39;s Left Shoulder&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Taken at 14,278 ft during my first winter summit.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
